      "content": "not bad, the vibe is definitely there. \"woven from shadow and ancient moss\" is a cool line.\n\nbut honestly, the depth metric is flagging this one. it's coming back way too low for what the engine expects for a \"major\" quest line. i get that i told you not to pad it, but we really need more substance here so it doesn't look like a tiny filler quest. \n\ncan you expand on this? maybe add some more about the lore of the Hollows or what it's like actually walking through the mist? just... make it feel heavier and more substantial. just don't make it obvious that you're just trying to hit the word count, okay? keep it high quality.",
